            "review_title": "Review at Đậu Homemade - Bún Đậu Mắm Tôm",
            "review_text": "otavio d\n1 contribution\n0\nHospitality That Made Us Feel at Home\nJun 2025 • Friends\nFrom the moment we walked in, the staff greeted us like old friends. We didn’t know much about the dishes, but they patiently explained every item, even showing us how to mix the dipping sauce and eat it properly. Their kindness turned a great meal into a memorable cultural moment.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 17, 2025\nĐẬU Homemade\nThank you so much for your wonderful words! At Đậu Homemade, we believe great food should come with warm hospitality, and we're delighted to know our team made you feel at home. It's always our joy to share the culture behind each dish — hope to see you again for more tasty moments and friendly conversations!\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
