            "review_text": "sertac s\n1 contribution\n0\nA Go-To Spot for Flavor, Comfort, and Culture\nJun 2025 • Friends\nThis restaurant checks all the boxes — tasty food, warm hospitality, great location, and even a touch of culture. The relaxing space makes it ideal for groups or families. You’ll leave full, happy, and maybe a little more culturally enriched!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 16, 2025\nĐẬU Homemade\nThank you so much for your thoughtful review! We’re delighted to know Đậu Homemade brought you not just flavor and comfort, but also a bit of Vietnamese culture. Creating a warm, memorable space for families and groups is exactly what we aim for. We look forward to welcoming you back soon!\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
